// '4060.b Spaceship' — thecali (CC0, public domain; crediting the
// artist encouraged; original at blendswap.com/blends/view/75686). The
// retro rocket on a dark studio floor: brushed metals at four roughness
// grades, a glass canopy over a red-lit cockpit. Official pbrt-v4
// export from https://benedikt-bitterli.me/resources/ —
// `scenes/corpus/fetch.sh spaceship` materializes the source; this RON
// was bootstrapped once by `cenote-cli import
// sources/bitterli/spaceship/scene-v4.pbrt` and is the source of truth
// — re-imports diff into scratch, never over it. The constant
// image-less infinite light lands as the derived, gitignored
// `spaceship-sky.exr` beside this file (README.md's mechanics section
// has the one-line regeneration recipe).
//
// Import fidelity: exact in effect — the importer averages pbrt's u/v
// roughness axes (×9), but every pair is equal-axis, so the average is
// the identity.
